{"3610790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hope in the City", "steam_appid": 3610790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4936570, 4978250], "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/2f6d2e1fac92f9c2d8ae6b882cc6ebac.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/2f6d2e1fac92f9c2d8ae6b882cc6ebac.avif?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope in the City is a narrative mystery game, set in the Chinese city of Shenyang, by the team behind the 2026 GDC Best in Play Winner Sky of Tides and the Annie Award-nominated Eternal Spring. Play as Hope, a 17-year-old girl investigating her parents' disappearance, connecting the clues and uncovering the truth hidden beneath the city's calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/3b19a2689e8c295f62285be35e51970c.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/3b19a2689e8c295f62285be35e51970c.webp?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/bb65b08f9a6c1612757e02b468e8e06d.poster.avif?t=1787906401\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/bb65b08f9a6c1612757e02b468e8e06d.webm?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/bb65b08f9a6c1612757e02b468e8e06d.mp4?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come home from school like any other day. But the house is too quiet. Your parents are gone, the apartment is in shambles. No note, no warning, no answer. Hope Song is 17, and she's just become the only person willing to ask what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/95cf591f95bd314adb7bc1f73fa438cd.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/95cf591f95bd314adb7bc1f73fa438cd.webp?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/34e8cc355cdf0c79a868ee10866633b2.poster.avif?t=1787906401\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/34e8cc355cdf0c79a868ee10866633b2.webm?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/34e8cc355cdf0c79a868ee10866633b2.mp4?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope isn't a detective. She's an artist. And that's exactly what makes her dangerous to whoever's hiding the truth. Every room holds details that don't add up: a shadow in the wrong place, an object that shouldn't be there, a lie in someone's eyes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture what you see as sketches in Hope's notebook. Every detail matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/fb860e7602b466a33245e8e274e9df46.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/fb860e7602b466a33245e8e274e9df46.webp?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/945511c0654918e9e933a5c56a7e219b.poster.avif?t=1787906401\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/945511c0654918e9e933a5c56a7e219b.webm?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/945511c0654918e9e933a5c56a7e219b.mp4?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect what you've seen into insights, and push those insights until they crack open into breakthroughs. Piece by piece, sketch by sketch, the picture of what happened to your parents starts to take shape, and it's darker than you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/6001ebc0ac2a842458f2ee7396b52034.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/6001ebc0ac2a842458f2ee7396b52034.webp?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ebfa3c4fb54e7eed2dec6864193517b0.poster.avif?t=1787906401\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ebfa3c4fb54e7eed2dec6864193517b0.webm?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/ebfa3c4fb54e7eed2dec6864193517b0.mp4?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenyang isn't just a backdrop, it's a character of its own. Rendered in a bold, stylized art style with an edge, every street, storefront, and shadowed alley is begging to be explored. Wander past neon signs and quiet corners alike, and let the city's striking visuals pull you deeper into its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/dba5f46eb9e94111caf0df3be6905819.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/dba5f46eb9e94111caf0df3be6905819.webp?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/cd4d3135b08c8393c8bc4075dc554cc6.poster.avif?t=1787906401\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/cd4d3135b08c8393c8bc4075dc554cc6.webm?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/cd4d3135b08c8393c8bc4075dc554cc6.mp4?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, it's just home: familiar streets, quiet neighbors, ordinary life. But beneath Hope's peaceful existence, secrets are buried. And now it's her time to find the truth.</p>", "