ou deeper into its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/dba5f46eb9e94111caf0df3be6905819.avif?t=1787906401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras_big/dba5f46eb9e94111caf0df3be6905819.webp?t=1787906401 width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/cd4d3135b08c8393c8bc4075dc554cc6.poster.avif?t=1787906401\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/cd4d3135b08c8393c8bc4075dc554cc6.webm?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/extras/cd4d3135b08c8393c8bc4075dc554cc6.mp4?t=1787906401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, it's just home: familiar streets, quiet neighbors, ordinary life. But beneath Hope's peaceful existence, secrets are buried. And now it's her time to find the truth.</p>", "short_description": "17-year-old Hope Song thought the national exams were her biggest worry... until she got home to a ransacked apartment and two missing parents. Investigate through the eyes of an artist, turn sketches into evidence, and watch her family's mystery grow stranger and darker with every answer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610790/ffb093c37d6c081471f4e01167500824fa13d927/header.jpg?t=1787906401", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_